#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/nitropc-pro-2.rst:45
#: bab3b2f2e36c4745ab53d42d9a5f6a5c
msgid ""
"Of special note for Qubes users, the NitroPC Pro 2 features a combined PS/2 "
"port that supports both a PS/2 keyboard and a PS/2 mouse simultaneously with "
"a Y-cable (not included). This allows for full control of dom0 without the "
"need for USB keyboard or mouse passthrough. Nitrokey also offers a special "
"tamper-evident shipping method for an additional fee. With this option, the "
"case screws will be individually sealed and photographed, and the NitroPC "
"Pro 2 will be packed inside a sealed bag. Photographs of the seals will be "
"sent to you by email, which you can use to determine whether the case was "
"opened during transit."
msgstr ""

